    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Large-Amplitude Motion [N]\n\nReleased from rest at $\\theta_1 = 2.0$ rad and $\\theta_2 = 2.5$ rad, both bobs start well above the pivot. CVODE runs for 20 s with relative and absolute tolerances of $10^{-12}$. The plot traces the lower bob, which loops over the top many times.",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "t_big : np_linspace(0.0, 20.0, 2001)$\ny0_big : [2.0, 2.5, 0.0, 0.0]$\ntraj : np_cvode(rhs_num, state, y0_big, t_big, 1e-12, 1e-12, adams)$\nrows : args(np_to_matrix(traj))$\nbob1(r) := [sin(r[2]), -cos(r[2])]$\nbob2(r) := [sin(r[2]) + sin(r[3]), -cos(r[2]) - cos(r[3])]$\npath2 : map(bob2, rows)$\n\nax_draw2d(\n  color=\"steelblue\", line_width=1, opacity=0.7, name=\"lower bob\",\n  lines(map(first, path2), map(second, path2)),\n  color=\"black\", marker_size=8, name=\"pivot\", points([0.0], [0.0]),\n  aspect_ratio=true, xrange=[-2.2, 2.2], yrange=[-2.2, 2.2],\n  title=\"Path of the Lower Bob, 0 to 20 s\", xlabel=\"x (m)\", ylabel=\"y (m)\",\n  showlegend=false\n)$",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": 10,
      "outputs": [
        {
