      "source": "## Summary\n\n| Step | Method |\n|------|--------|\n| Lagrangian | Symbolic: positions in $\\theta_1, \\theta_2$ with `depends`, $L = T - V$ |\n| Equations of motion | Symbolic: Euler–Lagrange with `diff`, `linsolve` for $\\ddot\\theta_1, \\ddot\\theta_2$ |\n| Normal modes | Symbolic: $\\det(K - \\omega^2 M_0) = 0$ gives $\\omega^2 = (g/l)(2 \\mp \\sqrt2)$; checked with `np_eig` |\n| Modes in motion | Numeric: `np_cvode` with zero-crossing events, periods match linear theory |\n| Large amplitude | Numeric: `np_cvode` at tolerance $10^{-12}$, energy drift as the check |\n| Chaos | Numeric: separation of runs $10^{-9}$ apart, Lyapunov exponent from a least-squares slope |\n| Animation | `animate` with `tellsimpafter` frame lookups |",
      "metadata": {}
