    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## References\n\n- L. D. Landau and E. M. Lifshitz, *Mechanics*, §5, Problem 1: the Lagrangian of a coplanar double pendulum.\n- Same, §23, Problem 2: its small oscillations, with frequencies $\\omega^2 = \\frac{g}{2m_1 l_1 l_2}\\{(m_1+m_2)(l_1+l_2) \\pm \\sqrt{(m_1+m_2)[(m_1+m_2)(l_1+l_2)^2 - 4 m_1 l_1 l_2]}\\}$, which reduce to $(2 \\pm \\sqrt 2)\\,g/l$ for equal masses and lengths.",
